//! A JSON value with JavaScript semantics: `JSON.parse` and `JSON.stringify`.
//!
//! OWNER: the contracts worker (ADR-0030). JavaScript objects order integer
//! keys first (ascending) and then the rest in insertion order; duplicate
//! keys keep the last value; numbers are doubles (`1e400` → Infinity is a
//! parse failure in zod's eyes, `-0` stays -0); lone surrogates in `\u`
//! escapes become U+FFFD (crate docs). `stringify` must equal
//! `JSON.stringify` byte for byte (prompts embed it). Checked against
//! `vectors/js/json.json` generated by Node.
